<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK SEP DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 391 MLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK SEP DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 391 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Monday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 391 million markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Oct 2			 1,800</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Oct		6,469</p>
<p> Average reserves to Sept 29			  8,198</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period	391</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
